[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978151298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107592#issuecomment-2978151298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107592","id":2978151298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xgvuC","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T21:07:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T21:08:22Z","body":"This is working as intended at the moment. The language server running in the Godot editor is only able to serve the project which is running in the current editor instance.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104401 introduces a warning about this limitation when trying to edit a different project than currently opened in the editor.\n\nIf you want to run two instances of Godot in parallel you need to ensure that each instance runs its own server. At the moment you will need to use the `--lsp-port` command line argument to start one Godot instance on a distinct port. Starting with Godot 4.5 you will also be able to override editor settings for each project (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/69012) which should make this setup much more manageable.\n\nIn addition you will have to ensure, that your code editor connects to the correct server for each project.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978151298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979142846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107592#issuecomment-2979142846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107592","id":2979142846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xkhy-","user":{"login":"KeebCat","id":70770307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzcwMzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70770307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat","html_url":"https://github.com/KeebCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T06:46:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T06:46:59Z","body":"That would explain the behavior, thank you for that information.\n\nWould it not be possible (and reasonable of course) to automatically handle which project's info is needed based on the file that's being edited? Nonetheless, that warning you're working on sounds acceptable as an alternative if the automatic switch can't happen. That would've saved me quite the headache trying to figure out what's wrong.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979142846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979351668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107592#issuecomment-2979351668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107592","id":2979351668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xlUx0","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T08:04:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T08:05:45Z","body":"The two Godot instances don't communicate in any form. The LS relies on the state of other Engine systems (e.g. ProjectSettings, ClassDB, ScriptServer which hold information on Global Classes and Auto loads amongst others). All those systems are singletons, and instance A has no way to access those singletons in instance B, so no it's technically infeasible.\n\nIt's also worth noting, that the general behavior of editing files from roots outside of the initialized workspace root (as in editing projects A and B in the same editor instance) is not clearly defined by LSP. See https://github.com/microsoft/language-server-protocol/issues/674. In theory the Godot Language server would require the editor to open a separate connection for the second project but there is no way to enforce this on a protocol level and even the VSCode Extension doesn't do this correctly.\n\nIf we could ensure, that the client opens different connections per workspace root, it would be possible to have a negotiator program which distributes requests to the correct Godot instance.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979351668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980432188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107592#issuecomment-2980432188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107592","id":2980432188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xpck8","user":{"login":"KeebCat","id":70770307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzcwMzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70770307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat","html_url":"https://github.com/KeebCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeebCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T13:40:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T13:40:10Z","body":"Alright, got it, thanks for the explanation. The planned warning is still better than nothing, so good luck on your pull request!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2980432188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]